---
import '../../styles/gateway.css';
const { content:c }=Astro.props;
const split=(s)=>s.split('\n');
const photo=(g)=>'/assets/'+g.imageKey+'.webp';
const icons=['M4 13a8 8 0 0 1 16 0M7 13a5 5 0 0 1 10 0M10 13a2 2 0 0 1 4 0M12 16v5','M5 19V9m5 10V5m5 14V2m5 17V7','M4 5h16v14H4zM4 9h16M8 13h3m3 0h3M8 16h8','M12 2 3 6v6c0 5 9 10 9 10s9-5 9-10V6zM8 12l3 3 5-6','M4 12h16M12 4v16M5 5l14 14M5 19 19 5','M4 18l4-7 5 4 7-11M16 4h4v4','M3 4h18v6H3zM3 14h18v6H3zM7 7h1m-1 10h1','M13 2 5 14h6l-1 8 9-13h-7z'];
---
<main id="main" class="ht-gateway" data-model={c.model}>
<div class="hero-band">
<img class="hero-background" src="/assets/sensor-hero-background.webp" width="1920" height="1090" alt="" aria-hidden="true" loading="eager" decoding="async"/>
<div class="wrap breadcrumb" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a><span>/</span><a href="/product/lists/cid/258#cate">IoT gateways</a><span>/</span><span>{c.model} {c.kind.toLowerCase()} gateway</span></div>
<section class="hero wrap" aria-labelledby="hero-title">
<div class="hero-heading"><h1 id="hero-title">{split(c.heroHeading).map((line,i)=><Fragment>{i>0&&<br/>}{line}</Fragment>)}<br/><span>{split(c.heroValue).map((line,i)=><Fragment>{i>0&&<br/>}{line}</Fragment>)}</span></h1></div>
<figure class="hero-visual gateway-product"><img src={'/assets/'+c.image} width={c.imageWidth} height={c.imageHeight} alt={c.imageAlt} fetchpriority="high" loading="eager" decoding="async"/><figcaption><span class="live-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>{c.caption}</figcaption></figure>
<p class="hero-description">{c.heroDescription}</p>
<div class="hero-actions"><a href="#enquiry" class="button button-primary">Discuss your project <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><a href="#specifications" class="text-link">View specifications <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div>
<div class="hero-proof">{c.proof.map(x=><div><strong>{x.value}</strong><span>{x.label}</span><small>{x.note}</small></div>)}</div>
</section></div>
<nav class="section-nav" aria-label="On this page"><div class="wrap"><a href="#network">Network planning</a><a href="#applications">Applications</a><a href="#specifications">Specifications</a><a href="#integration">Integration</a><a href="#faq">FAQ</a><a href="#enquiry" class="nav-quote">Request a quote ↗</a></div></nav>
<section class="section features-section" id="features"><div class="wrap"><div class="section-heading compact-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">KEY FEATURES</p><h2>{split(c.featureTitle).map((l,i)=><Fragment>{i>0&&<br/>}{i===0?l:<span>{l}</span>}</Fragment>)}</h2></div><p>{c.featureIntro}</p></div><div class="feature-grid">{c.features.map((f,i)=><article><span class="feature-mark" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="26" height="26" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d={icons[i]}/></svg></span><h3>{f.title}</h3><p>{f.text}</p></article>)}</div></div></section>
<section class="section measurement-section" id="network"><div class="wrap"><div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">NETWORK PLANNING</p><h2>Start with the site.<br/><span>Define the data path.</span></h2></div><p>{c.planningIntro}</p></div><div class="measurement-grid">{c.planning.map((p,i)=><article class="measurement-card"><div class="measurement-heading"><span class="measurement-number">0{i+1}</span><span class="measurement-symbol" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></div><h3>{p.title}</h3><p>{p.text}</p><dl><dt>Plan your network</dt><dd>{p.brief}</dd></dl><a class="text-link" href="#enquiry">Discuss network planning ↗</a></article>)}</div><div class="installation-note"><span class="small-label">PLACEMENT & INSTALLATION</span><h3>Position the gateway.<br/>Verify the complete link.</h3><p>{c.installationText}</p></div></div></section>
<section class="section profile-section" id="operating-profile"><div class="wrap"><div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">FROM SENSOR TO RESPONSE</p><h2>Collect the data.<br/>Connect your operation.</h2></div><p>Separate sensor measurement, gateway forwarding and platform response. Define the reporting profile and verify each stage with real devices before deployment.</p></div><div class="gateway-workflow">{c.workflow.map((x,i)=><article><span class="step-number">0{i+1}</span><h3>{x.title}</h3><p>{x.text}</p></article>)}</div><div class="profile-note"><div><span class="small-label">RADIO COVERAGE REFERENCE</span><strong>{split(c.coverageTitle).map((l,i)=><Fragment>{i>0&&<br/>}{l}</Fragment>)}</strong></div><p>{c.coverageText}</p></div></div></section>
<section class="section application-section" id="applications"><div class="wrap"><div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">APPLICATIONS</p><h2>{c.kind} connectivity.<br/><span>Across your operation.</span></h2></div><p>{c.model==='H66'?'Connect compatible sensors across building services, storage areas, production facilities and technical rooms. Organize the network around the spaces and equipment your team monitors.':'Connect compatible sensors across outdoor industrial facilities, water infrastructure, renewable-energy sites and distributed assets. Plan each location around power, radio paths and backhaul.'}</p></div><div class="application-overview"><p><strong>{c.groups.length}</strong> application categories <span>/</span> <strong>{c.groups.reduce((n,g)=>n+g.tasks.length,0)}</strong> monitoring tasks</p><p class="image-note">Representative environments. Suitability depends on sensor compatibility, radio coverage, power and platform integration.</p></div><nav class="application-jump-nav" aria-label="Browse gateway applications">{c.groups.map(g=><a href={'#group-'+g.id}>{g.jumpLabel}<span>{g.tasks.length}</span></a>)}</nav><div class="application-groups">{c.groups.map((g,i)=><details class="application-group" id={'group-'+g.id} open={i===0}><summary><span><small>{String(i+1).padStart(2,'0')}</small>{g.title}</span><span class="group-count">{g.tasks.length} monitoring tasks <b aria-hidden="true">+</b></span></summary><div class="application-category-body"><div class="application-visual"><div class="application-media-slot"><figure class="application-category-photo"><img class="application-category-image" src={photo(g)} width="960" height="640" alt={g.imageAlt} loading="lazy" decoding="async"/><figcaption>{g.imageCaption}</figcaption></figure></div><p>{g.intro}</p></div><div class="application-task-list">{g.tasks.map((t,j)=><details class="application-task" id={t.id} open={i===0&&j===0}><summary aria-controls={'scene-photo-'+t.id}><span class="task-heading"><h3>{t.title}</h3><small>{t.networkRole}</small></span><span class="task-toggle" aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary><div class="task-copy"><figure class="application-scene-photo" id={'scene-photo-'+t.id} data-scene-owner={t.id}><img class="application-scene-image" src={photo(g)} width="960" height="640" alt={g.imageAlt} loading="lazy" decoding="async"/><figcaption>{g.imageCaption}</figcaption></figure><p>{t.description}</p><dl><dt>Gateway role</dt><dd>{t.networkRole}</dd><dt>Deployment considerations</dt><dd>{t.placement}</dd><dt>Project details</dt><dd>{t.projectBrief}</dd></dl><a href="#enquiry" class="task-cta" data-project-scene={t.title}>Discuss this application <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></details>)}</div></div></details>)}</div></div></section>
<section class="section specifications-section" id="specifications"><div class="wrap"><div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">TECHNICAL SPECIFICATIONS</p><h2>The right gateway.<br/><span>The right configuration.</span></h2></div><p>Use the model reference below to plan the project. Select the regional radio version, backhaul, antenna arrangement and mounting for the actual installation.</p></div><div class="gateway-spec-grid"><aside class="model-card"><span class="small-label">{c.model} · {c.kind.toUpperCase()} GATEWAY</span><h3>Specify the network.<br/>Confirm the installation.</h3><p>{c.specNote}</p><a href="#enquiry" class="button button-outline">Get a configuration proposal ↗</a><a class="text-link" href="#enquiry">Request project datasheet ↗</a></aside><div class="spec-table"><table><caption>{c.model} {c.kind.toLowerCase()} IoT gateway — model reference</caption><tbody>{c.rows.map(([label,value])=><tr><th scope="row">{label}</th><td>{value}</td></tr>)}</tbody></table></div></div><div class="selection-list"><h3>Bring the specification back to your project.</h3><div>{[['Define the sensor network','Device models, radio protocol, country, device count and reporting profile.'],['Define the installation','Gateway position, antenna, power, environmental conditions and mounting.'],['Define the receiving system','Backhaul, MQTT endpoint, data mapping, alert recipients and acceptance test.']].map(([a,b],i)=><article><span class="step-number">0{i+1}</span><h4>{a}</h4><p>{b}</p></article>)}</div></div></div></section>
<section class="section integration-section" id="integration"><div class="wrap"><div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">CONNECTIVITY & INTEGRATION</p><h2>Your sensors.<br/><span>Your data destination.</span></h2></div><p>Connect field measurements to Hitelecom Cloud or a compatible customer platform. Keep sensor compatibility, gateway forwarding and platform services defined in the same integration plan.</p></div><div class="integration-grid"><article><span class="small-label">HITELECOM CLOUD</span><h3>View data. Set thresholds. Act.</h3><div class="route-flow"><span>LoRa sensors</span><b>→</b><span>{c.model}</span><b>→</b><span>Hitelecom Cloud</span></div><p>View uploaded monitoring data online and receive alerts when measurements exceed configured thresholds. Configure the monitoring points, limits and notification recipients around the site's operating procedures.</p><ul><li>Online access to uploaded monitoring data</li><li>Configured threshold alarms and notification workflow</li><li>Agreed sampling, reporting and response requirements</li></ul></article><article><span class="small-label">CUSTOMER PLATFORM</span><h3>Integrate the records you need.</h3><div class="route-flow"><span>Sensor records</span><b>→</b><span>MQTT</span><b>→</b><span>Your platform</span></div><p>Agree the MQTT connection and payload mapping with the receiving system. Define device identity, measurement units and timestamps so records can be interpreted consistently.</p><ul><li>Endpoint, topics and message format</li><li>Supported authentication and transport-security settings</li><li>End-to-end verification with representative devices</li></ul></article></div><div class="integration-handover"><h3>Commission the complete monitoring path.</h3><p>Verify a known sensor reading at the receiving platform, then test a configured threshold event and its notification recipient. Record the actual radio and backhaul conditions as part of the handover.</p><a class="text-link" href="#enquiry">Discuss platform integration ↗</a></div></div></section>
<section class="section faq-section" id="faq"><div class="wrap faq-layout"><div class="faq-intro"><p class="eyebrow">ANSWERS FOR YOUR PROJECT</p><h2>Frequently<br/>asked questions.</h2><p>Practical answers for gateway selection, radio planning, installation and platform integration.</p><a href="#enquiry" class="text-link">Ask about your project ↗</a></div><div class="faq-list">{c.faqs.map((f,i)=><details id={'faq-'+(i+1)} open={i===0}><summary>{f.q}<span aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary><div class="faq-answer"><p>{f.a}</p></div></details>)}</div></div></section>
<section class="section enquiry-section" id="enquiry"><div class="wrap enquiry-layout"><div class="enquiry-intro"><p class="eyebrow">LET'S TALK ABOUT YOUR PROJECT</p><h2>Your sensor network.<br/><span>Our next conversation.</span></h2><p class="lead">Share the site, sensor fleet and data destination. We’ll help define the {c.model} configuration, coverage assessment and integration scope.</p><a class="contact-email" href="mailto:sales@hitelecom.cn">sales@hitelecom.cn ↗</a><div class="enquiry-benefits"><h3>Start with the site and the devices.</h3><p>A site drawing, sensor list and reporting profile give the project a useful starting point. Add the installation country and receiving platform when available.</p></div></div><form id="enquiry-form" action="mailto:sales@hitelecom.cn" method="post" enctype="text/plain"><div class="form-heading"><span class="small-label">PROJECT ENQUIRY</span><h3>Let’s plan your gateway deployment.</h3><p>{c.model} {c.kind.toLowerCase()} IoT gateway</p></div><div class="form-fields"><input type="hidden" name="Model" value={c.model}/><div class="field"><label for="application">Application *</label><select id="application" name="Application" required><option value="">Choose your application</option>{c.groups.map(g=><optgroup label={g.title}>{g.tasks.map(t=><option value={t.title}>{t.title}</option>)}</optgroup>)}<option>Other / project-specific</option></select></div><div class="field"><label for="country">Country / region *</label><input id="country" name="Country" required autocomplete="country-name" maxlength="100" placeholder="Installation country"/></div><div class="field"><label for="device-count">Sensor count</label><input id="device-count" name="Sensor count" type="number" min="1" step="1" inputmode="numeric" placeholder="e.g. 100"/></div><div class="field"><label for="quantity">Gateway quantity</label><input id="quantity" name="Gateway quantity" type="number" min="1" step="1" inputmode="numeric" placeholder="Please advise"/></div><div class="field full"><label for="sensors">Sensor models & reporting</label><input id="sensors" name="Sensor models and reporting" maxlength="800" placeholder="Device models, radio protocol, payload and reporting interval"/></div><div class="field full"><label for="platform">Backhaul & platform</label><input id="platform" name="Backhaul and platform" maxlength="800" placeholder="4G LTE or required Ethernet configuration; Hitelecom Cloud or your platform"/></div><div class="field full"><label for="requirements">Site & project requirements</label><textarea id="requirements" name="Requirements" rows="4" maxlength="3000" placeholder="Site layout, gateway position, power, antenna, coverage and required notification workflow"></textarea></div></div><div class="form-actions"><button type="submit" class="button button-primary">Prepare my enquiry ↗</button><p>Review your brief, then send it with your email app.</p></div><div class="enquiry-review" id="enquiry-review" hidden><label for="enquiry-brief">Your project brief</label><textarea id="enquiry-brief" rows="10" spellcheck="false"></textarea><div><a class="button button-primary" id="email-brief" href="mailto:sales@hitelecom.cn">Open email ↗</a><button type="button" id="copy-brief" class="button button-outline">Copy brief</button></div><p id="brief-status" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p></div><noscript><p class="noscript-note">You can also <a href={'mailto:sales@hitelecom.cn?subject='+encodeURIComponent(c.model+' gateway project')}>email your project details directly</a>.</p></noscript></form></div></section>
<div class="wrap related-products"><p class="small-label">CONTINUE YOUR MONITORING PROJECT</p><a href={c.model==='H66'?'/product/outdoor-4g-gateway-h68':'/product/indoor-gateway-h66'}>Explore {c.model==='H66'?'H68 outdoor':'H66 indoor'} gateway ↗</a><a href="/product/lists/cid/261#cate">Explore IoT sensors ↗</a><a href="/product/temperature-sensor">Temperature monitoring ↗</a></div>
</main>
<script>import './gateway-interactions.js';</script>
